OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, nine, wins national farming
OL,4,Aaward
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nine-year-old girl has been
OL,7,Frecognised at a national awards
OL,8,Fceremony celebrating the next
OL,9,Fgeneration of British farmers.
OL,11,FEdie King from Lancashire was named
OL,12,FJunior Young Handler of the Year in the
OL,13,Fsix to 10 age category at the Young
OL,14,FBritish Farming Awards 2026.
OL,16,FJudges praised her dedication to sheep
OL,17,Fshowing and animal welfare. They said
OL,18,Fshe takes an active role in caring for
OL,19,Fher animals, from lambing season
OL,20,Fthrough to preparing them for
OL,21,Fagricultural shows.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
