OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, nine, wins national farming
OL,4,Aaward
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe award organisers said Edie is
OL,7,Fresponsible for washing, trimming and
OL,8,Fpreparing her sheep for competition and
OL,9,Falready has a collection of
OL,10,Fchampionships and rosettes to her name.
